   "description": "Built on science, Sleep Cycle uses sound analysis to track and improve sleep for over 3 million users worldwide. Our AI sleep coach, sleep tracker and Smart Alarm clock app help users to identify potential sleep issues, gain valuable insights into their sleep patterns and build a healthier sleep routine.\n\nSleep Cycle is the world\u2019s no.1 sleep app with more than 40 million downloads. Track your rest, wake refreshed, and build lifelong sleep habits.\n\nAWARDS & RECOGNITIONS\nSleep Cycle has been awarded Best Sleep App in 2024 by Digital Health Magazine and featured as App of the Month in Wellness Today. In 2024, Sleep Cycle won two Merit Healthcare Awards: Gold for Mobile Digital Health Resources and Silver for Best Use of Artificial Intelligence.\n\nWITH SLEEP CYCLE YOU CAN\n\u2022 Get guidance based on your sleep patterns with our AI sleep coach Luma. \n\u2022 Wake up gently during your lightest sleep phase with our Smart Alarm clock.\n\u2022 Track every night using patented sound technology or accelerometer-based sleep detection, no wearables needed.\n\u2022 Detect nighttime noises like snoring, coughing, or sleep talking, for a path to quieter sleep.\n\u2022 Drift off easily using our sleep sounds library of relaxing stories, sleepy soundscapes and guided meditations.\n\u2022 Understand your sleep patterns with long-term trends and compare your sleep to global benchmarks.\n\u2022 Log sleep notes to understand how caffeine, stress, or exercise affect your rest.\n\nWHY USE SLEEP CYCLE?\n\u2022 Wake feeling refreshed with no more groggy mornings.\n\u2022 Get daily stats to help you understand your rest.\n\u2022 Sleep guidance based on your tracked nights.\n\u2022 Health insights with snoring and cough tracking for wellness.\n\u2022 No gadgets, just place your phone on the nightstand.\n\u2022 Premium tools like supportive soundscapes, sleep stories, data export, Philips HUE sunrise and Apple Health sync.\n\nABOUT SLEEP CYCLE\nSleep Cycle helps you sleep smarter. Track your nights, gain valuable insights into your sleep patterns, and wake at just the right time to start the day energized. Sleep Cycle gives you science-backed tools and an AI sleep coach Luma to help you improve your sleep for brighter days.\n\nOur popular features include:\n\u2022 Superior sleep tracker.\n\u2022 AI sleep coach.\n\u2022 Smart Alarm clock.\n\u2022 Sleep talking recorder.\n\u2022 Advanced sleep analysis.\n\u2022 Snore tracker.\n\u2022 Sleep timer. \n\u2022 Cough recorder.\n\u2022 Sleep stages.\n\u2022 Sleep programs.\n\u2022 SleepGPT.\n\u2022 Sleep goal and score.\n\u2022 Relaxing sleep sounds like nature, rain and ocean sounds.\n\u2022 Sleep Aid including calming meditations and breathing exercises.\n\u2022 And more features to help you improve your rest.\n\n\nTALK TO US\nIf you need any help please contact our customer service at support.sleepcycle.com\n \nJOIN THE COMMUNITY\n \u25b6 Web: https://sleepcycle.com/\n \u25b6 Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/sleepcycleapp/\n \u25b6 TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@sleep_cycle\n \u25b6 Reddit: https://www.reddit.com/r/sleepcycle/\n\nTerms & Privacy\nhttps://www.sleepcycle.com/privacy-policy/ \n\nDOWNLOAD NOW \u2013 Sleep Better with Sleep Cycle",
